     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I believe I have fixed the problem! Hopefully my asking of questions and follow up with code which (I think) is correct helps others :) <div><br></div><div><div><b>#Changed set-up of year effects</b></div><div>years = as.factor(rep(c(&#39;2016&#39;,&#39;2017&#39;), nSites))</div><div>years.cov = data.frame(years)</div></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>#Had to keep unlist() function, changed set-up of newdata.3</b></div><div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>fm2 &lt;- colext(psiformula = ~1, gammaformula = ~1, epsilonformula = ~1, pformula = ~unlist(years.cov), data = FosnUMF, se = TRUE)</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>  newdata.3 &lt;- data.frame(years.cov = factor(rep(c(&#39;2016&#39;,&#39;2017&#39;))))</div><div>  fm2.year &lt;- predict(fm2, newdata=newdata.3, type=&quot;det&quot;, appendData=TRUE) #Year-specific Detection</div></div><div><br></div><div><b>#Results of Predict()</b></div><div><div> Predicted         SE                  lower     upper           years.cov</div><div>1 0.1468637 0.08384911 0.04431730 0.3898894      2016</div><div>2 0.1420031 0.07836613 0.04481353 0.3686283      2017</div></div></div>"
